<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) were a shade weaker on Wednesday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.50 percent, while the three-month rate was at 21.23 percent, both down by 0.01 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
